OL,3,CDock danger plea from houseboat
OL,4,Cresident who repeatedly warns of risks
OL,6,FA man who lives on a houseboat close
OL,7,Fto where a 14-year-old boy drowned
OL,8,Fsays he has been worried about safety
OL,9,Fand often tells children of the danger.
OL,11,FBrett Findlay says he understands why
OL,12,Fpeople want to go in the water during
OL,13,Fhot weather, but he said teenagers
OL,14,Fwere not interested hearing about the
OL,15,Frisks.
OL,17,FPolice were called to Millwall Outer
OL,18,FDock on Monday evening where a boy was
OL,19,Fpulled from the water. Mr Findlay said
OL,20,Fmore warning signs are needed and more
OL,21,Feducation in schools.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
