FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785939499
OL,3,CDock danger plea from houseboat
OL,4,Cresident who repeatedly warns of risks
OL,6,F"Nearly every year a kid is pulled out
OL,7,Fof the docks," he told ITV News London.
OL,9,F"Every year I walk around telling them
OL,10,Fthat somebody's been pulled out of the
OL,11,Fdocks.
OL,13,F"They get upset. They just want to
OL,14,Fjump in the water and have a nice
OL,15,Ftime. It's hot. I get it. I understand
OL,16,Fit.
OL,18,F"But they're not interested. Something
OL,19,Fneeds to happen. There needs to be
OL,20,Fsome kind of campaign through the
OL,21,Fschools, some more signage put up."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
