OL,3,CDock danger plea from houseboat
OL,4,Cresident who repeatedly warns of risks
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe Royal Life Saving Society
OL,12,Fpreviously issued a plea for everyone
OL,13,Fto "stop and think" before getting in
OL,14,Fthe water in response to the deaths,
OL,15,Fmany of whom were children.
OL,17,FAt least 39 deaths have been reported
OL,18,Fthis summer from open-water incidents.
OL,26,@uD@DOUuD@SO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
