OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785939499
OL,3,CDock danger plea from houseboat
OL,4,Cresident who repeatedly warns of risks
OL,6,FThe National Water Safety Forum
OL,7,Freported there were 202 water-related
OL,8,Ffatalities across the whole of last
OL,9,Fyear in the UK, adding that 2026 data
OL,10,Fwill not be published until May next
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FA child died in June after being
OL,14,Fpulled out of open water at London's
OL,15,FRoyal Victoria Dock.
OL,17,FEmergency services were called to
OL,18,Freports of a child in the water on
OL,19,FSilvertown Way, and a boy, believed to
OL,20,Fbe 13, was recovered from the water.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/5
