PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785939499
OL,3,CDock danger plea from houseboat
OL,4,Cresident who repeatedly warns of risks
OL,6,FLast month, a seven-year-old boy died
OL,7,Fafter an incident at a beach which
OL,8,Falso left his teenage cousin and her
OL,9,Fmother dead.
OL,11,FMusa Ahmed, his cousin Sameeha Rahman,
OL,12,F15, and her mother Shelina Rahman, 41,
OL,13,Fwere in the water with three other
OL,14,Ffamily members when they got into
OL,15,Fdifficulty in West Mersea, Essex, on
OL,16,FJuly 22.
OL,18,FSameeha and Shelina Rahman, from the
OL,19,FIlford area of east London, died at
OL,20,Fthe scene, and Musa was flown to
OL,21,Fhospital but died a week later.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/5
